  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Drain sweetcorn. Heat a large frying pan over high heat. Cook corn kernels until lightly browned, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a medium bowl.\n• Meanwhile, roughly chop cucumber and pickled jalapeños (if using). Transfer to bowl with the charred corn. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper to taste. TIP: Cover the pan with a lid if the corn kernels are “popping” out.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d9093f40fa258a6f0d2ae9/step-bd594911.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic. Drain and rinse chickpeas.\n• Return pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook garlic, All-American spice blend and tomato paste, stirring, until fragrant, 1 minute. Add chickpeas and the water and cook until slightly thickened, 3-4 minutes. Stir in the plant-based butter until melted and combined.\n• Remove pan from heat. Lightly mash chickpeas with a potato masher or fork (add a splash of water if the mixture looks too thick). Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d9093f40fa258a6f0d2ae9/step-261b6844.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While chickpeas are cooking, in a second medium bowl, combine slaw mix, and a drizzle of olive oil and white wine vinegar. Season to taste.\n• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a plate for 10 second bursts, or until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d9093f40fa258a6f0d2ae9/step-19fe64cb.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread each tortilla with plant-based aioli. Top with slaw and American-style smashed chickpeas.\n• Top with jalapeño-corn salsa to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d9093f40fa258a6f0d2ae9/step-5447f295.jpg"
    }
  ]
